# Native projects are generated by `npx expo prebuild` (Continuous Native
# Generation). Everything that used to be hand-held in ios/ now lives in
# app.json — Info.plist keys under ios.infoPlist, the privacy manifest under
# ios.privacyManifests, and the splash under the expo-splash-screen plugin.
# Regenerate with `npm run prebuild`; EAS Build runs prebuild for you.
